"<classname>std::vector</classname>?"

#. (itstool) path: answer/para
#: C/faq.xml:134
msgid ""
"Yes, we believe in reusing standard <phrase role=\"nowrap\">C++</phrase> "
"code wherever possible. This might not be obvious at first because gtkmm has "
"<classname>Glib::ustring</classname> which has almost the same interface as "
